The '''New Year Cake Bag''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Accessory]] purchasable from the {{NPCSprite|Baker}} during the [[New Year Celebration]] for {{c|250000}}.

== Description ==
The '''New Year Cake Bag''' holds [[New Year Cake]]s. Each unique New Year Cake in the bag grants the player {{Green|+1}} {{stat|hp}}, with the bag being able to hold up to {{Green|54}} total cakes. The effect does not stack. 

The '''New Year Cake''' is considered unique if there is only one cake per year. For example, two cakes obtained during Year 70 will only grant {{Stat|hp|+1}} instead of {{Stat|hp|+2|icononly=yes}}.

== Notes ==
*Having multiple '''New Year Cake Bags''' in [[Accessory Bag]], will count the {{stat|hp}} bonus from the first one only, regardless of if there is a stronger one.

